# coffee-sales-dashboard
Coffee Sales  Analysis Dashboard using Power BI

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- Excel
- DAX

## Project Description
This dashboard analyzes coffee sales data to identify sales trends,
customer preferences, and high-performing products.

## Key Insights
- Total Sales
- Total Revenue
- Product-wise Sales
- Monthly Sales Trends
- Customer Purchase Patterns

